docs {
  # Get Group Members (`GetGroupMembers`)
  
  **Handler**: `handlers.GetGroupMembers` in [group_handler.go](file:///d:/Codes/budget-tracker/go-server/handlers/group_handler.go)
  **Route**: `GET /api/_private/v1/groups/:groupId/members` (Private - Bearer Token required)
  
  ### Description
  Returns a list of all members affiliated with the group, preloaded with their user profile and role (`ADMIN` or `MEMBER`).
  
  ### Path Parameters
  - `groupId` (string, path parameter): Group ID.
}
